# Web-Manage / face kiosk

## Kiosk

- Route: `/company/timestamp-face` → `enroll-face` standalone component
- Multi-person: IoU tracks, smooth boxes, per-`memberId` cooldown
- Prefer **WebSocket** `/face/ws/kiosk` for identify + walk-by check-in; HTTP fallback if WS down
- Crop faces before send; do not upload full frames for multi-person
- Cap concurrent check-ins / identifies; never global-lock the whole camera for one person

## Angular habits

- Standalone components where the feature already is standalone
- Use `NgZone` + `ChangeDetectorRef` when updating UI from `setInterval` / WS / face-api
- Production `environment.prod.ts` uses `baseUrl: ''` (same-origin via nginx)
- Rebuild `admin` image after UI changes: `docker compose ... up -d --build admin`

## UI

- Keep kiosk overlay readable (name + confidence on box); avoid cluttering the first camera viewport
- Toast + feed panel for results; soft-fail walk-by misses (toast, retry track) instead of spamming error feed
